# Reflection

This project reinforced the importance of iterative engineering design, hardware/software integration, and designing fallback behaviors for unreliable sensor conditions. Although the robot did not fully perform as intended during competition, the project demonstrated strong problem-solving, rapid iteration, and embedded systems development under real-world constraints.
